        "candidate_id": "C_7ed53b416005d5d4_1",
        "edit": "Replaced the incorrect sum assignment `assign s=(~(a&b)&ci);` with the correct full-adder XOR expression `assign s=(a^b^ci);`. The carry logic is unchanged. This fixes the observed output mismatches (e.g., cycle2 got 00 expected 01, cycle3 got 11 expected 10) by computing the proper sum of a, b, and ci.",
